# Supply Method

Grouping column **`Supply Method`** on Plain Database and Packs. Live CL uses NocoDB **`Stock_Type`** (same role); readers normalize via `shared.supply_method.normalize_stock_type` (locked 2026-10-04). Not the old CL `Warehouse Stock` stock-qty column (China bags).

Code: `shared/supply_method.py`. One-off fill scripts retired while CL is NocoDB-owned.

| Cell | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `Warehouse Stock` | **CL (via Stock_Type):** `Warehouse Stock`, `Warehouse Stock (Non-Seasonal)`, `Warehouse Stock (Seasonal)`. **Plain / Packs / classify rules:** FOTL men / women / kids t-shirts in the locked colour lists, plus Kids `C800T` / `C8030T` in the locked body colours |
| `In House Manufacture` | Iron-on or sticker (printed / CL only); Stock_Type value of the same name |
| `Supplier On Demand` | Everything else; Stock_Type `Order on Demand` or `Supplier On Demand` |

Blank `Stock_Type` stays blank (do not invent).

### NocoDB Stock_Type → locked trio (`normalize_stock_type`)

| Live `Stock_Type` | Supply Method |
|---|---|
| `Order on Demand` | `Supplier On Demand` |
| `Supplier On Demand` | `Supplier On Demand` |
| `Warehouse Stock` | `Warehouse Stock` |
| `Warehouse Stock (Non-Seasonal)` | `Warehouse Stock` |
| `Warehouse Stock (Seasonal)` | `Warehouse Stock` |
| `In House Manufacture` | `In House Manufacture` |
| (blank) | (blank) |

Seasonal = we stock it in season (e.g. sweatshirts/hoodies); still Warehouse Stock for grouping.

CL decision order:

1. Custom Label (SKU) or Gender Apparel contains `iron on` / `ironon` / `iron-on` / `sticker` → `In House Manufacture`
2. Else Kids **and** Custom Label / Gender Apparel / Supplier Product Code contains `C800T` or `C8030T` **and** `Colour` is on the body list → `Warehouse Stock`
3. Else FOTL identity **and** `Category (Areeb)` = `T-SHIRTS` **and** not vest/tank **and** `Department (Areeb)` + `Colour` hit that department’s list → `Warehouse Stock`
4. Else → `Supplier On Demand`

FOTL identity: Brand contains Fruit + Loom, or Brand/GA `FOTL`/`FOLT`, or GA is `Mens-T-Shirt` / `Womens-T-Shirt` / `Kids-T-Shirt` with blank Brand. **Gildan brand always wins** (on-demand).

Colour match is the whole `Colour` cell, casefold only. Ladies = `Womens`. `C8030T` is Product Type Romper in the catalog; the style code is what counts. `C8020T` and `BZ10-Body Suit` are not warehouse stock.

